#taxon[Observation]
#title[Cartesian decompositions and rectangles agree in non-empty case]

In the case where $S: "FinSet"$ is non-empty the type of general cartesian decompositions on $S$ agrees with the type of non-degenerate cartesian decompositions on $S$.

